Comment: 0,0:00:36.34,0:00:38.88,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{Opening}
Comment: 0,0:23:00.35,0:23:12.86,Ending,,0000,0000,0000,,{Ending}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.96,0:00:14.63,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Damn cake...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.24,0:00:23.24,Default,Ginsei,0000,0000,0000,,How pathetic you look....
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.01,0:00:32.03,Default,Ginsei,0000,0000,0000,,Iorogi.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.54,0:02:19.70,Default,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,It's Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.00,0:02:21.91,Default,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,Morning, Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.91,0:02:23.45,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.95,0:02:27.70,Default,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato! Can I tie a ribbon on him?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.38,0:02:30.19,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Him?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.19,0:02:32.21,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, you mean Ioryogi?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.21,0:02:35.03,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, come on now. Give me a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.03,0:02:36.93,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, please do!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.24,0:02:44.02,Default,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,So cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.02,0:02:46.55,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes! I'm sure Ioryogi is pleased too!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.79,0:02:48.60,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Who's pleased?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.18,0:02:53.84,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.84,0:02:55.61,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning, Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.96,0:02:57.36,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,We'll be counting on you today too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.36,0:02:58.44,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.61,0:03:06.41,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Then I'll be back later okay, Ioryogi?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.72,0:03:16.91,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder why she carries that around.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.91,0:03:18.93,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure it's because it's something important.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.58,0:03:28.85,Default,Bear,0000,0000,0000,,Yum, yum!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.36,0:03:34.15,Default,Bear,0000,0000,0000,,Baumkuchen, bakey, bakey.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.15,0:03:36.85,Default,Bear,0000,0000,0000,,Ha, bakey, bakey!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.80,0:03:41.36,Default,Bear,0000,0000,0000,,The bear in the forest is baking...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.15,0:03:43.40,Default,Bear,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.40,0:03:44.48,Default,Bear,0000,0000,0000,,How annoying.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.93,0:03:47.37,Default,Bear,0000,0000,0000,,Hurry up and just get in. Ginsei.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.40,0:03:53.85,Default,Bear,0000,0000,0000,,He's not here, just to tell ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.85,0:03:55.47,Default,Ginsei,0000,0000,0000,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.47,0:03:57.42,Default,Bear,0000,0000,0000,,So then what're you here for?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.02,0:04:00.28,Default,Ginsei,0000,0000,0000,,I just wanted to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.28,0:04:02.42,Default,Ginsei,0000,0000,0000,,What that guy is thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.42,0:04:05.44,Default,Bear,0000,0000,0000,,Why ask me? Hmph.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.44,0:04:05.93,Default,Bear,0000,0000,0000,,Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.92,0:04:11.11,Default,Bear,0000,0000,0000,,Even though we're in these forms now,\Nwe're both inhabitants of the spirit world.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.11,0:04:12.42,Default,Ginsei,0000,0000,0000,,What's all this about now?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.42,0:04:14.68,Default,Bear,0000,0000,0000,,It's been like this since the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.18,0:04:20.44,Default,Bear,0000,0000,0000,,The heavenly world, the human world, the underworld, and the spirit world.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.43,0:04:24.36,Default,Bear,0000,0000,0000,,The only ones not conscious of the existence of these separate worlds
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.36,0:04:27.19,Default,Bear,0000,0000,0000,,are the humans of the human world.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.32,0:04:31.76,Default,Bear,0000,0000,0000,,In the heavenly world resides the angels under God's control,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.38,0:04:37.06,Default,Bear,0000,0000,0000,,in the underworld, the demons under the Devil,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.05,0:04:43.77,Default,Bear,0000,0000,0000,,and in the spirit world, there's us under the King of Spirits.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.65,0:04:49.74,Default,Bear,0000,0000,0000,,In each of these worlds,\Nnonaggression is the fundamental rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.74,0:04:51.43,Default,Bear,0000,0000,0000,,And yet, that stupid Iorogi....
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.98,0:04:53.79,Default,Bear,0000,0000,0000,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.21,0:04:57.26,Default,Bear,0000,0000,0000,,Right, right, that slightly stupid Iorogi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.08,0:05:02.50,Default,Bear,0000,0000,0000,,He tried to start a war with heaven and\Nwhat you're looking at is the result of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.73,0:05:08.57,Default,Bear,0000,0000,0000,,The reason Iorogi tried to start a war\Nwith heaven in the first place was because
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.31,0:05:12.45,Default,Bear,0000,0000,0000,,there was something there that he just had to have, no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.57,0:05:15.15,Default,Bear,0000,0000,0000,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.15,0:05:17.25,Default,Ginsei,0000,0000,0000,,He wasn't able to get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.78,0:05:23.26,Default,Bear,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. It would've been better if he had just tried to slip in quietly and steal it like the Devil's brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.36,0:05:26.05,Default,Bear,0000,0000,0000,,But in the end, it was our loss,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.05,0:05:29.51,Default,Bear,0000,0000,0000,,and for the crime of violating the ban on aggression, he was turned into a stuffed animal.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.02,0:05:32.91,Default,Bear,0000,0000,0000,,I became the bear of this\NBear's Baunkuchen Shop,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.91,0:05:35.43,Default,Bear,0000,0000,0000,,and Zuisho was changed into that strange looking bird.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.08,0:05:40.94,Default,Bear,0000,0000,0000,,I guess the almighty God\Ncan lose his patience too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.76,0:05:47.03,Default,Bear,0000,0000,0000,,We got dragged in, but as the ringleader, he got the worst end of the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.00,0:05:50.99,Default,Ginsei,0000,0000,0000,,What does Iorogi have to do in order to be able to return to the spirit world?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.00,0:05:58.65,Default,Bear,0000,0000,0000,,Until that girl's wish is granted, Iorogi is stuck in that form and can't return to the spirit world.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.65,0:05:59.82,Default,Ginsei,0000,0000,0000,,Her wish?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.92,0:06:09.89,Default,Bear,0000,0000,0000,,When her bottle is filled with the healed\Nhearts of humans, her wish will come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.88,0:06:13.69,Default,Bear,0000,0000,0000,,His contract with God is to help her fulfill her wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.33,0:06:17.93,Default,Bear,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know what he's thinking either.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.57,0:06:23.90,Default,Bear,0000,0000,0000,,But what I can say is that ever since Iorogi came to the human world...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.90,0:06:28.69,Default,Bear,0000,0000,0000,,No, he's changed ever since he started living with that girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.59,0:06:31.88,Default,Bear,0000,0000,0000,,Just leave him be for a while, why don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.88,0:06:33.00,Default,Bear,0000,0000,0000,,Why don't you have a taste of—
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.52,0:06:35.19,Default,Bear,0000,0000,0000,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.06,0:06:37.99,Default,Bear,0000,0000,0000,,Jeez.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.16,0:06:41.48,Default,Bear,0000,0000,0000,,And it's so delicious too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.20,0:06:46.45,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,If any of my friends from before saw me like this, they'd cry!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.43,0:06:50.84,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.57,0:07:07.43,Default,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,You can't catch me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.43,0:07:09.44,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning, Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.57,0:07:11.96,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Domoto!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.70,0:07:15.38,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Why did you come to the Nursery?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.38,0:07:17.50,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,I just had to see Kiyokazu about something.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.53,0:07:21.65,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Guys, it's time for lunch!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.65,0:07:23.22,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Wash your hands and go inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.22,0:07:24.54,Default,Children,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.54,0:07:25.07,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,Kiyokazu.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.01,0:07:28.59,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.59,0:07:32.46,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,I thought it would be a good idea for you to come to today's seminar so I came by to get you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.89,0:07:34.71,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not going.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.71,0:07:37.57,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,And I came here with my hopes up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.57,0:07:39.75,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,A semi what...?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.75,0:07:42.09,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,A seminar. For college.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.09,0:07:44.75,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, it's for college?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.75,0:07:45.23,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.93,0:07:48.19,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,You didn't go last time, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.19,0:07:50.33,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,I think it'd be a good idea for you to show up this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.33,0:07:52.78,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Please go, Fujimoto!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.78,0:07:54.57,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Can't. I'm busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.32,0:08:00.45,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.45,0:08:04.80,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato! Don't worry, I have an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.69,0:08:11.36,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,That's enough for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.36,0:08:13.49,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,You have an important seminar to attend this afternoon, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.49,0:08:14.93,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Miss Sayaka...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.51,0:08:19.42,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,I've come here many times to help out too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.42,0:08:21.14,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,That's when I noticed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.63,0:08:25.10,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,In the afternoon, the kids have nap time,\Nand Kobato will still be around to help out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.10,0:08:26.24,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,We'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.24,0:08:27.39,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.39,0:08:31.24,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto, you're always such a big help.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.24,0:08:34.44,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,But I would really like it if you actually went to college.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.18,0:08:37.15,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.46,0:08:39.58,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.02,0:08:41.78,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,He's so obedient!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.78,0:08:45.83,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,He's only obedient for Miss Sayaka.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.63,0:08:50.77,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,I can't deal with this piece of crap anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.57,0:09:13.19,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,See you, Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.19,0:09:13.94,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,I'll be back some other time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.94,0:09:16.54,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, please come visit again!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.68,0:09:18.72,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,Bye for now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.90,0:09:24.02,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Have a safe trip!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.12,0:09:30.64,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'll try my best to do Fujimoto's work!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.59,0:09:45.16,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Wow, that's great!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.28,0:09:57.01,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,I can't get it off! Damn that\NFujimoto for tying it so tightly!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.80,0:10:31.15,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you so much for today, Kobato. You being here was really a huge help!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.15,0:10:32.84,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I wasn't really—
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.84,0:10:35.15,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Go home and get a good rest, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.15,0:10:36.36,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.46,0:10:40.41,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,That ribbon looks good on little Ioryogi, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.82,0:10:45.02,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Little... Ioryogi...?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.32,0:10:48.42,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.42,0:10:50.17,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,See you tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.58,0:11:01.02,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,It's still kind of hot out, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.39,0:11:10.31,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,The earthy places are cool though. {土のある所}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.30,0:11:16.23,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, that feels nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.23,0:11:18.23,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Doesn't it, Ioryogi?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.18,0:11:19.94,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.67,0:11:25.79,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,What do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.34,0:11:29.49,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Your head was all scrunched up right here, Ioryogi!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.44,0:11:32.44,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Do you know why?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.44,0:11:35.00,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Is it because you're hungry?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.77,0:11:47.83,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.06,0:11:53.15,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,The seasons are changing, one after another.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.15,0:11:58.02,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,You didn't come here to help out at the Nursery, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.05,0:12:07.73,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,But today, Fujimoto wasn't here and I wanted to make up for his share of the work as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.73,0:12:09.19,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,That's just it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.52,0:12:11.19,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,You should be doing what you came here to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.22,0:12:20.04,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,If you don't hurry up and fill up this bottle,\Nyour wish won't be able to come true anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.07,0:12:32.29,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Ginsei!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.29,0:12:34.30,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,A friend of yours, Ioryogi?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.46,0:12:49.54,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.50,0:12:53.41,Default,Ginsei,0000,0000,0000,,It's her, isn't it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.43,0:12:56.17,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.91,0:13:18.39,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.27,0:13:47.09,Default,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,Hm? Isn't that...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.80,0:13:56.97,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,You ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.97,0:14:00.14,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,If that breaks, money can't buy another one!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.42,0:14:02.31,Default,Ginsei,0000,0000,0000,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.82,0:14:07.98,Default,Ginsei,0000,0000,0000,,Why do you plan on staying in that form here in the human world for so long?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.56,0:14:13.99,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,I have something I need to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.75,0:14:27.65,Default,Zuishou,0000,0000,0000,,Master Genko!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.49,0:14:31.37,Default,Genko,0000,0000,0000,,Zuisho! Don't be flapping around inside!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.37,0:14:33.27,Default,Genko,0000,0000,0000,,You'll get feathers in the batter!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.27,0:14:36.97,Default,Zuishou,0000,0000,0000,,I can't help it. I'm a bird right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.97,0:14:39.26,Default,Genko,0000,0000,0000,,I know, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.26,0:14:40.30,Default,Genko,0000,0000,0000,,So, what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.30,0:14:41.69,Default,Zuishou,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, right!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.69,0:14:46.15,Default,Zuishou,0000,0000,0000,,That violent and selfish guy who is\Nstuck in the form of a stuffed animal
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.15,0:14:48.11,Default,Zuishou,0000,0000,0000,,and the reckless one who was here earlier
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.11,0:14:51.16,Default,Zuishou,0000,0000,0000,,are now locked together in what\Nseems to be an explosive situation!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.87,0:14:53.85,Default,Genko,0000,0000,0000,,Is that so.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.85,0:14:55.50,Default,Zuishou,0000,0000,0000,,That's all you have to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.37,0:15:00.30,Default,Genko,0000,0000,0000,,Then take this and give it to the loser as a get-well present.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.30,0:15:01.77,Default,Zuishou,0000,0000,0000,,Can we really leave them be?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.77,0:15:05.14,Default,Zuishou,0000,0000,0000,,Those two spell big trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.14,0:15:07.51,Default,Genko,0000,0000,0000,,No one would be able to get between them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.95,0:15:11.50,Default,Genko,0000,0000,0000,,Iorogi was the one who took in Ginsei in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.94,0:15:14.31,Default,Genko,0000,0000,0000,,Iorogi even named him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.31,0:15:18.57,Default,Genko,0000,0000,0000,,His eyes are silver and he's a\Nsilver being. That's why he's Ginsei.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.81,0:15:22.40,Default,Genko,0000,0000,0000,,No matter what happens, that's their relationship.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.89,0:15:27.10,Default,Genko,0000,0000,0000,,I did try to stop them, but it\Njust devolved into a fist fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.10,0:15:27.98,Default,Zuishou,0000,0000,0000,,I'll bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.15,0:15:34.87,Default,Genko,0000,0000,0000,,He was picked up and named by Iorogi; it's no wonder that he continues to obsess over him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.87,0:15:38.47,Default,Genko,0000,0000,0000,,There's no choice but to let them resolve it themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.54,0:15:55.93,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Give back the bottle.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.65,0:16:00.37,Default,Ginsei,0000,0000,0000,,Come and get it yourself, {\i1}Ioryogi.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.16,0:16:04.39,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Watch it, I'll burn you where you lay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.38,0:16:13.67,Default,Ginsei,0000,0000,0000,,There's no way you could hold me down in that form.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.67,0:16:14.77,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Why you—!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.22,0:16:16.73,Default,Ginsei,0000,0000,0000,,Pathetic, aren't you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.73,0:16:19.02,Default,Ginsei,0000,0000,0000,,In shape and in name.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.02,0:16:20.78,Default,Ginsei,0000,0000,0000,,What the hell's this "Ioryogi" nonsense?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.49,0:16:25.21,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I-o...ryo?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.59,0:16:30.27,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,I-o-ro-gi.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.49,0:16:33.58,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I-o-ryo-gi?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.56,0:16:35.75,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,I-o-ro-gi, dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.75,0:16:38.40,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I-o-ryo-gi?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.40,0:16:41.03,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Wrong! Ioryogi!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.88,0:16:45.31,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Got it, Ioryogi!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.69,0:16:50.75,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,I've become fond of having my name pronounced like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.75,0:16:53.32,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Just give back the bottle already.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.07,0:16:56.90,Default,Ginsei,0000,0000,0000,,Say that you'll return to the spirit world.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.90,0:16:59.50,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,I told you I have something I need to do, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.50,0:17:03.33,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not going back, at least not until I see this through.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.91,0:17:07.29,Default,Ginsei,0000,0000,0000,,That... wish thing, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.58,0:17:11.93,Default,Ginsei,0000,0000,0000,,What is it about that girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.43,0:17:15.92,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,She's...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.85,0:17:19.68,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,...put me through some terrible things.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.07,0:17:25.35,Default,Ginsei,0000,0000,0000,,Then just get rid of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.35,0:17:26.43,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.43,0:17:30.22,Default,Ginsei,0000,0000,0000,,If that girl wasn't here, you wouldn't have to worry about wishes or any of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.22,0:17:32.19,Default,Ginsei,0000,0000,0000,,You should also be able to return to the spirit world.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.01,0:17:35.27,Default,Ginsei,0000,0000,0000,,The you of the past would have done so.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.80,0:17:37.70,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Probably would've.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.28,0:17:41.55,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,That girl's clumsy and knows nothing of charm...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.19,0:17:44.46,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'll do my best!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.41,0:17:50.25,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,...and always puts others before\Nherself to the point of exhaustion,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.25,0:17:53.43,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,even though they never asked her to.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.57,0:17:55.21,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,But you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.33,0:18:01.54,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,That doesn't make me hate her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.52,0:18:09.40,Default,Ginsei,0000,0000,0000,,I can't listen to this anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.40,0:18:12.51,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Darn you, my stuffing's coming out here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.51,0:18:16.73,Default,Ginsei,0000,0000,0000,,If she doesn't fill up this bottle,\Nher wish won't be able to come true...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.49,0:18:18.74,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Ginsei!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.23,0:18:22.06,Default,Ginsei,0000,0000,0000,,Then if there's no bottle...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.91,0:18:23.83,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.58,0:18:31.94,Default,Ginsei,0000,0000,0000,,I have no intention of listening to you when you're like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.32,0:18:35.33,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Ginsei!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.82,0:18:36.53,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.31,0:18:41.46,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Please give back the bottle.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.60,0:18:47.03,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Without that, Kobato...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.42,0:18:49.49,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm begging you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.78,0:18:55.98,Default,Genko,0000,0000,0000,,He's changed ever since he\Nstarted living with that girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.45,0:19:00.74,Default,Ginsei,0000,0000,0000,,"I'm begging you"?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.18,0:19:07.01,Default,Ginsei,0000,0000,0000,,You never would've said\Nsomething like that in the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.78,0:19:26.89,Default,Ginsei,0000,0000,0000,,Hurry up and fulfill your goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.18,0:19:30.03,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Ginsei...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.07,0:19:37.41,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.43,0:19:40.32,Default,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.32,0:19:42.08,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Kohaku!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.08,0:19:44.06,Default,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.06,0:19:46.46,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi's disappeared!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.56,0:19:51.70,Default,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi? He was in Sakura Park...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.41,0:19:55.84,Default,Ginsei,0000,0000,0000,,Come, catch me if you can!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.84,0:19:57.67,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.67,0:20:02.30,Default,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,It seemed like he was having fun playing tag with a friend from the spirit world,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.30,0:20:04.22,Default,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,so I didn't call out to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.87,0:20:06.47,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,At Sakura Park you said?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.47,0:20:08.20,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.40,0:20:11.49,Default,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,You're welcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.38,0:20:25.57,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Damn this inconvenient body!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.57,0:20:27.51,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,But if I can make it this far—
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.66,0:20:45.49,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,That hurts, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.49,0:20:47.62,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.00,0:20:54.76,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi! Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.71,0:20:57.71,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.64,0:20:59.52,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.46,0:21:02.77,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.52,0:21:06.56,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.56,0:21:08.02,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.78,0:21:11.12,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Thank goodness, Ioryogi!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.30,0:21:15.97,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you so much for finding Ioryogi!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.51,0:21:21.55,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi got lost and...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.20,0:21:23.21,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Got lost?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.21,0:21:27.08,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'm so, so glad he's all right!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.08,0:21:30.02,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Is that thing really important?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.48,0:21:34.88,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes! Ioryogi and I have always been together!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.12,0:21:39.82,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Yummy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.87,0:21:45.08,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,That bear—how thoughtful.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.39,0:21:54.60,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,It looks really good on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.60,0:21:55.91,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,You!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.91,0:21:57.07,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.72,0:22:03.76,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you for bringing back this bottle for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.76,0:22:05.24,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'm so grateful!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.07,0:22:09.01,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Dobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.26,0:22:11.96,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Minus 200 points!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.64,0:22:17.26,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,What were you doing?! Why did you let your bottle get stolen like that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.06,0:22:19.77,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.96,0:22:25.94,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Is today some sort of dress up day?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.94,0:22:28.57,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,All of you have been tying this thing on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.19,0:22:33.83,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi and I have always been together!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.28,0:22:40.65,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.65,0:22:41.62,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.62,0:22:44.10,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,The ribbon does look nice on you, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.10,0:22:45.25,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Not at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.25,0:22:46.46,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Of course it does!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.46,0:22:49.17,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Look, if we tie one more, it'll be even—
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.17,0:22:50.10,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, stop that!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.10,0:22:52.96,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,And then if we tie another one on top of that...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.10,0:22:54.28,Default Alt,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, I said stop!!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.28,0:22:56.52,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Let's tie just one more!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.40,0:22:58.52,Default Alt,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Sto-mmph!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.85,0:03:31.85,Signs,,0000,0000,0000,,{\t(\fscy100\fscx80)\be1\an8\bord2\b1\3c&H2B496E&\fs30\fnAmpersand\c&H97B0F6&\move(636,322,572,289,0,2987)}The Bear{\fnAnnifont\i1}'{\fnAmpersand\i0}s\NBaumkuchen\NShop
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.23,0:00:44.03,Title Screen,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(300,0)\pos(340,90)}Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.03,0:00:51.70,Title Screen,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(0,500)\t(\fscy140\fscx120)\move(340,90,340,45)}Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.27,0:00:46.88,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}How do I do this again?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.17,0:00:51.47,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}The simplest things in life
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.50,0:00:55.48,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}end up being the most difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.71,0:00:58.28,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I just want to smile when I'm happy
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.55,0:01:05.62,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}and sing a song whenever I please.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.04,0:01:11.20,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I was told, "Someday,\Nyour dream will come true."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.99,0:01:15.04,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}But when exactly will that be?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.21,0:01:18.58,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I can't wait that long!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.83,0:01:21.64,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I spread my arms
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.78,0:01:24.38,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}on the count of one two three
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.63,0:01:29.63,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}and gather all the light in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.81,0:01:32.44,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}Tell me,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.45,0:01:36.03,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}isn't there something I can do?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.06,0:01:38.79,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}Even if someone hurts my feelings,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.86,0:01:41.53,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I'll keep running toward the light.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.76,0:01:48.41,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}Even if I trip, fall, and cry my eyes out, I still believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.70,0:01:52.42,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}Although it may seem silly...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.23,0:01:57.07,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I believe in tomorrow.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:44.27,0:00:46.88,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}How do I do this again?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:47.17,0:00:51.47,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}The simplest things in life
Dialogue: 1,0:00:52.50,0:00:55.48,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}end up being the most difficult.
