Dialogue: 1,0:01:21.78,0:01:24.38,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}on the count of one two three
Dialogue: 1,0:01:24.63,0:01:29.63,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}and gather all the light in the world.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:29.81,0:01:32.44,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}Tell me,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:32.45,0:01:36.03,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}isn't there something I can do?
