Dialogue: 1,0:02:01.01,0:02:06.31,Episode Titles,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(300,0)\fs20\bord1.2\pos(360,360)\3c&H33322F&}Production\N{\fs25}The Kobato Protection Group
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.81,0:02:12.82,Episode Titles,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fsp2\fad(800,800)\pos(365,205)\blur5\bord0\c&H000000&}...Silver Eyes.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:06.81,0:02:12.82,Episode Titles,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fsp2\fad(800,800)\pos(360,200)\bord1.6}...Silver Eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.71,0:23:08.04,Ending,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\pos(360,460)\fad(200,200)}Even though we all want to fly,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.50,0:23:15.28,Ending,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\pos(360,460)\fad(200,200)}w{\fsp3}e{\fsp-4}'{\fsp0}re being deceived by gravity.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.81,0:23:23.45,Ending,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\pos(360,460)\fad(200,200)}In reality, everybody can already fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.85,0:23:32.06,Ending,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\pos(360,460)\fad(200,200)}The reason why that child looks so sad
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.34,0:23:43.03,Ending,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\pos(360,460)\fad(200,200)}might be because she left her shadow somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.54,0:23:45.72,Ending,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\pos(360,460)\fad(200,200)}If so...
